and build with Core Web Vitals in mind—so the site is both beautiful and fast.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you help with multilingual / inbound-friendly UX and copy?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We can design multilingual pages, multilingual navigation, and UX/copy that resonates with international audiences and inbound visitors.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you build full e-commerce sites?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not at the moment. We’re focused on corporate sites, brand sites, landing pages, and recruitment sites where storytelling and experience design matter most.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we hire you for SEO-only work (operations/content only)?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We don’t take SEO-only engagements. However, as part of a build, we do structure, on-page SEO, and performance-focused implementation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you build with no-code tools like Framer / Webflow?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No—we don’t produce sites on no-code platforms. To achieve high-end interaction and performance, we build with custom code.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you do development / 3D implementation only if our team provides design?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. If you provide design files, we can handle front-end development, animation implementation, and real-time 3D (WebGL/WebGPU). We’ll align on technical requirements (motion, performance, supported devices) before production, and can also give implementation feedback if needed.\"}}]}"],"features":["contact-form","faq","x-posts"],"html":"<div class=\"progressive-blur\" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            z-index: 1;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to t