 an emotional, scroll-driven digital experience—built with real-time 3D and chapter-based narrative to make the brand felt, not just read.</p></div></a><a href=\"/blog/vectr-ai-startup-branding-case-study\" target=\"_self\" class=\"services__card bg-card sc-link\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__image-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><img src=\"/_astro/vectr.B3z6mDBo_Z30Ofu.webp\" alt=\"Vectr brand and WebGPU marketing site for an AI staffing startup.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" class=\"services__image\"></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Vectr<br>Brand &amp; Website</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>A high-impact brand identity and WebGPU marketing site for an AI-driven precision staffing startup serving high-consequence industrial environments. Cinematic real-time 3D, app-like transitions, and a tuned asset pipeline—awarded FWA of the Day.</p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zYeUg-8WQrM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"services__card bg-card sc-link\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__image-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><img src=\"/_astro/jr.Dn1pvQvw_Z24RYr8.webp\" alt=\"JR West digital installation turning employee messages into a real-time 3D city.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" class=\"services__image\"></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>JR West<br>Digital Installation</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>As part of JR West’s new HQ renewal in Osaka, we created an interactive digital installation that turns employee messages into a living 3D city—designed to communicate vision, spark emotion, and drive sharing.</p></div></a></div><a class=\"services__see-more services__see-more--footer\" href=\"https://works.utsubo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb> See more work → </a></div></section></div><div class=\"web-x-posts flx-column\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><div class=\"x-posts-sticky\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><div class=\"x-posts-wrapper flx-center\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><div class=\"x-posts-title sec-layout\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><h2 class=\"en\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><span data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o>We craft experiences<br> that make people talk.</span> More than 5 million views and counting. </h2></div><div class=\"x-posts x-posts--desktop\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><div class=\"x-posts__col\" data-scroll-percent=\"100\" data-direction=\"bottom-to-top\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><a href=\"https://x.com/utsuboco/status/1864993538859323897\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"x-posts__item\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><img src=\"/_astro/left-01.IdYoxu0o_Z15Pvdx.webp\" alt=\"X post: A bold new chapter begins at Kiasa. 44,000 views\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"1000\" height=\"758\"></a><a href=\"https://x.com/Ocelyn/status/1900344988061622411\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"x-posts__item\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><img src=\"/_astro/left-02.D46YCMFE_Z4bE4L.webp\" alt=\"X post: Oh… you can clone websites now. 976,000 views\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1100\"><div class=\"x-posts__highlight three\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><span data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><strong>976.9K</strong> Views</span><img src=\"/landing/common/arrow-xposts.svg\" width=\"49\" height=\"23\" alt=\"arrow icon\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"arrowpointing\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o></div></a><a href=\"https://x.com/lucas_f