2prm6x5o=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1126\"></a><div class=\"x-posts__item\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o><img src=\"/_astro/right-04.Br-mc2KU_w8ba3.webp\" alt=\"X post: This website is peak. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-2prm6x5o=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1100\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"big-py\" data-astro-cid-2gvpmdwd><section class=\"services flx-column tnv-anim\"><div class=\"services-details flx\"><div class=\"services-card prod\"><h2 class=\"small-title\">Our Specialties</h2><ul class=\"services-list\"><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-1\">Technical Direction</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-2\">Technical Consulting</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-3\">Realtime 3D / WebGL / WebGPU</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-4\">Interactive Motion Design</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-5\">Interactive Installations</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-6\">Websites &amp; Web Games</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-7\">AR / VR / XR</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"services-card design\"><h2 class=\"small-title\">Our Strengths</h2><ul class=\"services-list\"><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-1\">Art Direction</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-2\">UI/UX Design</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-3\">Motion Design</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-4\">Sound Design</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-5\">3D Modeling</span></li><li class=\"services-item\"><span class=\"si-item si-6\">Animation</span></li></ul></div></div></section></div><section id=\"faqs\" class=\"lp-faq flx-column\"><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main \">FAQs</h2></div><div class=\"lp-faq__list\"><div class=\"lp-faq__item open\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What budget should we expect for a website?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: none;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>It depends on scope, but typical starting points are: simple landing pages from ~$5k, corporate sites from ~$20k. If you want rich animation, interaction, or real-time 3D, we’ll quote based on requirements after a quick call.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">−</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>How long does it take?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Landing pages typically take 4–6 weeks. Corporate websites are usually 8–16 weeks. Timelines vary depending on copy, photography, and whether you need CMS setup.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you handle SEO and performance (Core Web Vitals)?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We design the information architecture, implement solid on-page SEO, and build with Core Web Vitals in mind—so the site is both beautiful and fast.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can you help with multilingual / inbound-friendly UX and copy?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We can design multilingual pages, multilingual navigation, and UX/copy that resonates with international audiences and inbound visitors.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you build full e-commerce sites?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Not at the moment. We’re focused on corporate sites, brand sites, landing pages, and recruitment sites where storytelling and experience design matter most.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can we hire you for SEO-only work (operations/content only)?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>We don’t take SEO-only engagements. However, as part of a build, we do structure, on-page SEO, and performance-focused implementation.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you build with no-code tools like Framer / Webflow?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>No—we don’t produce sites on no-code platforms. To achieve high-end interaction and performance, we build with custom code.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can you do development / 3D implementation only if our team provides design?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. If you provide design files, we can handle front-end development, animation implementation, and real-time 3D (WebGL/WebGPU). We’ll align on technical requirements (motion, performance, supported devices) before production, and can also give implementation feedback if needed.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>How do we start?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p><a href=\"https://cal.com/utsubo/30min?source_url=%2Fosaka-web-agency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free 30-minute consultation</a>. Tell us your goal (leads / hiring / branding) and your current situation, and we'll propose a structure and ballpark estimate.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can we meet in Osaka for an in-person discussion?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We typically move fast online, and when helpful we can also meet in <a href='https://maps.app.goo.gl/YNMmcpeVudtSNTPy6' target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Osaka City (around Shinsaibashi)</a>.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-contact flx-center\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-card bg-card\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-mc flx\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div c